  "title": "Call the function",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## A name is not a call\n\n`ping` is the function. `ping()` runs it and gives you `\"pong\"`. Printing the function itself is not the same as printing its result."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "call-vs-name",
      "promptMd": "What does `console.log(ping)` print (not `ping()`)?",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "pong",
          "md": "`pong`"
        },
        {
          "id": "fn",
          "md": "The function text — you never called it",
          "misconceptionId": "print-is-return"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "fn"
    },
    {
